==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=nl|/ˈtaːfəl/}}
* {{audio|Nl-tafel.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|tafele}}, from {{der|nl|la|tabula||board}}. Doublet with Dutch {{m|nl|tabel}}.

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|f|-s|pl2=-@en|tafeltje}}

# {{l|en|table}} (item of furniture)
# {{lb|nl|metonymy}} a {{l|en|meal}}, {{l|en|spread}} on (a) table(s)
# {{lb|nl|arithmetic}} {{l|en|multiplication table}}
# a writing {{l|en|tablet}}

====Usage notes====
The plural {{m|nl||tafelen}} is only used in the sense "writing tablet".

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|furniture}} {{l|nl|dis}}
* {{sense|meal}} {{l|nl|maaltijd}}, {{l|nl|maal}}
* {{sense|tablet}} {{l|nl|tablet}}

